    {
      "local_id": "claim-local-1",
      "text": "老树说，很久很久以前没有山、没有树，什么都没有，只有一片无边的大海。",
      "certainty": "reported",
      "attributed_to_candidate_or_ref": {
        "candidate_name": "老树"
      },
      "revealed_at": 50,
      "source_refs": [
        {
          "path": "source/vol-002/ch-000050.txt",
          "chapter_id": "ch-000050",
          "chapter_order": 50,
          "locator": null,
          "anchor": "只有一片大海，无边的大海"
        }
      ],
      "basis_refs": [],
      "supersedes_refs": []
    },
    {
      "local_id": "claim-local-2",
      "text": "老树自称身上年轮有九百圈，也曾是一颗种子、一棵小苗。",
      "certainty": "reported",
      "attributed_to_candidate_or_ref": {
        "candidate_name": "老树"
      },
      "revealed_at": 50,
      "source_refs": [
        {
          "path": "source/vol-002/ch-000050.txt",
          "chapter_id": "ch-000050",
          "chapter_order": 50,
          "locator": null,
          "anchor": "我身上的年轮有九百圈了"
        }
      ],
      "basis_refs": [],
      "supersedes_refs": []
    },
    {
      "local_id": "claim-local-3",
      "text": "松鼠问自己是否也是从地里长出来的，并因自己没有叶子而难过。",
      "certainty": "reported",
      "attributed_to_candidate_or_ref": {
        "path": "characters/char-0112/index.json",
        "record_id": "char-0112"
      },
      "revealed_at": 50,
      "source_refs": [
        {
          "path": "source/vol-002/ch-000050.txt",
          "chapter_id": "ch-000050",
          "chapter_order": 50,
          "locator": null,
          "anchor": "为什么我没有叶子呢"
        }
      ],
      "basis_refs": [],
      "supersedes_refs": []
    },
    {
      "local_id": "claim-local-4",
      "text": "老树对松鼠说，松鼠能摆脱泥土的羁绊、自由奔跑，这一点让它羡慕。",
      "certainty": "reported",
      "attributed_to_candidate_or_ref": {
        "candidate_name": "老树"
      },
      "revealed_at": 50,
      "source_refs": [
        {
          "path": "source/vol-002/ch-000050.txt",
          "chapter_id": "ch-000050",
          "chapter_order": 50,
          "locator": null,
          "anchor": null
