      ],
      "basis_refs": [],
      "supersedes_refs": []
    },
    {
      "local_id": "claim-local-5",
      "text": "老树说它很想看到大海，每年都有海鸟的羽毛飘落带来海洋的气息。",
      "certainty": "reported",
      "attributed_to_candidate_or_ref": {
        "candidate_name": "老树"
      },
      "revealed_at": 50,
      "source_refs": [
        {
          "path": "source/vol-002/ch-000050.txt",
          "chapter_id": "ch-000050",
          "chapter_order": 50,
          "locator": null,
          "anchor": "我是多么想看到大海啊"
        }
      ],
      "basis_refs": [],
      "supersedes_refs": []
    },
    {
      "local_id": "claim-local-6",
      "text": "老树说，听说一直爬到这块大地最高的地方，就可以知道世界是什么样的。",
      "certainty": "reported",
      "attributed_to_candidate_or_ref": {
        "candidate_name": "老树"
      },
      "revealed_at": 50,
      "source_refs": [
        {
          "path": "source/vol-002/ch-000050.txt",
          "chapter_id": "ch-000050",
          "chapter_order": 50,
          "locator": null,
          "anchor": "你一直爬到这块大地最高的地方"
        }
      ],
      "basis_refs": [],
      "supersedes_refs": []
    },
    {
      "local_id": "claim-local-7",
      "text": "松鼠答应老树：会每天去旅行，把看见的回来告诉老树。",
      "certainty": "reported",
      "attributed_to_candidate_or_ref": {
        "path": "characters/char-0112/index.json",
